  Project modifications are provided under Apache-2.0; all upstream notices
  and dependency license grants above are retained.

ReShade (BSD-3-Clause OR MIT)
  Copyright 2014/2021 Patrick Mours; https://github.com/crosire/reshade
  Addon API 20 headers are retained under third_party/reshade with their
  original notices and license text. The optional runtime uses pinned v6.8.0
  source at 18deaa52de0c425a78b329e9cb3c497281cd00ec plus the documented
